# .trivyignore — Documented suppressions for HIGH/CRITICAL CVEs
#
# Trivy automatically reads this file when scanning images.
# Each entry must include the CVE ID and a justification comment.
#
# Format:
#   # Justification for suppression
#   CVE-XXXX-XXXXX
#
# No suppressions yet. Add entries here only when a CVE is:
#   - Not fixable upstream (no patched version available)
#   - A false positive for our usage
#   - Mitigated by other controls (network policy, runtime restrictions)
